OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADad hails 'breakthrough' Child
OL,4,ATrust Fund change
OL,5,
OL,6,FA promised law change making it easier
OL,7,Ffor young disabled people's families to
OL,8,Faccess their savings in Child Trust
OL,9,FFunds is a "breakthrough moment", one
OL,10,Ffather says.
OL,12,FThe families of some people with
OL,13,Flearning disabilities have had to go
OL,14,Fthrough long court procedures to access
OL,15,Ftheir savings at 18 because, in the
OL,16,Fofficial legal terminology, their
OL,17,Fchildren "lack mental capacity".
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
