OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADad hails 'breakthrough' Child
OL,4,ATrust Fund change
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrew Turner, from Horsham in West
OL,7,FSussex, who has campaigned for change
OL,8,Ffor six years after having issues
OL,9,Faccessing his son Mikey's money when he
OL,10,Fturned 18, said: "I think it's a
OL,11,Fvictory for common sense.
OL,13,F"It's going to be fantastic news for
OL,14,Fthousands of disabled young people."
